---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Solid State Physics Cheat Sheet | Free Crystal Structures, Band Theory"
  description="Complete solid state physics cheat sheet with crystal structures and band theory. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Solid State Physics<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Crystal structures and band theory. From lattice vibrations to semiconductors.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Crystal Structures</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Lattice Types</h3>
        <pre><code>Simple cubic (SC)
Body-centered cubic (BCC)
Face-centered cubic (FCC)
Hexagonal close-packed (HCP)
Diamond cubic</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Lattice Parameters</h3>
        <pre><code>a, b, c: lattice constants
α, β, γ: angles
Volume = abc sin(α) for triclinic
Packing fraction = V_atoms/V_cell</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Band Theory</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Energy Bands</h3>
        <pre><code>Valence band: filled states
Conduction band: empty states
Band gap: E_g (insulator: large, semiconductor: small, metal: zero)
E_F: Fermi energy (0K: highest filled state)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Conductivity</h3>
        <pre><code>σ = neμ (conductivity)
n: carrier concentration
μ: mobility
Metal: n large, σ large
Semiconductor: n small, σ intermediate
Insulator: n ≈ 0, σ ≈ 0</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Lattice Vibrations</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Phonons</h3>
        <pre><code>Quantized lattice vibrations
Acoustic phonons: low frequency
Optical phonons: high frequency
E = ℏω (phonon energy)
D(ω): density of states</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Superconductivity</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>Zero resistance below T_c
Meissner effect (expulsion of magnetic field)
BCS theory: Cooper pairs
Energy gap: 2Δ
Critical fields: H_c, H_c1, H_c2</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
